# KiCad's own scratch: autosave archives, footprint cache, per-user view prefs,
# lock files. Regenerated on open; none of it is the design.
*-backups/
fp-info-cache
*.kicad_prl
*.lck
~*.lck
_autosave-*
*-save.kicad_*
# DRC/ERC reports are re-run, not kept
*.rpt
# make_fab.sh plots into fab/gerbers/ then zips it; the zip is the artifact
# that was uploaded, the loose plots are rebuilt every run.
fab/gerbers/
